    id: "retailpred", title: "retailPRED — demand forecasting that survives real time", subtitle: "Point-in-time backtesting and model governance on Databricks: revised history made LightGBM look unbeatable until every training set was rebuilt as it existed at each forecast date — then a gate written first said no, to the champion and to every challenger that followed.",
